_prefix_note() {
    cat <<'EOF'
==> affinity-bin: Wine prefix notes

The AppImage copies its bundled Wine prefix to ~/.affinity-appimage-wineprefix
only on first start and never refreshes it. If Affinity crashes after a
package upgrade (e.g. with "Couldn't find a compatible Webview2 Runtime"),
recreate the prefix:

    mv ~/.affinity-appimage-wineprefix ~/.affinity-appimage-wineprefix.old

A freshly created prefix has no Z: drive, so Wine's file dialog cannot browse
outside the prefix. Restore it with:

    ln -s / ~/.affinity-appimage-wineprefix/dosdevices/z:
EOF
}

post_install() {
    _prefix_note
}

post_upgrade() {
    _prefix_note
}
